{"thread":{"threadID":4156,"boardID":166,"topic":"TTT-Jail-Maps-Vorschlage","time":1486360503,"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","lastPostTime":1486504155,"lastPoster":"Nachtfrische","replies":19,"views":682,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":3},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":61159,"threadID":4156,"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","subject":"TTT-Jail-Maps-Vorschlage","time":1486360503,"lastEditTime":1486374138,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":2185,"editor":"Ibo107","likes":[{"userID":2416,"username":"Road2Esel","time":1486364566,"value":1},{"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","time":1486364954,"value":1},{"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","time":1486390838,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Habe mir mal paar raus gesucht</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>-TTT-Maps-</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>1/ <a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/183275\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>2/ <a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/191111\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>3/ <a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/191585\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>4/  <a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/191682\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>5/ <a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/193939\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>-Jail-Maps-</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>1/ <a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/168080\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>2/ <a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/180817\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>3/ <a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/174966\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>4/ <a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/187577\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>5/ <a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/183738\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich danke <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2332-exo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@exo</a> er hat mich auf die Idee gebracht UND AN <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1153-schockly/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Schockly</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>und <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2416-road2esel/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Road2Esel</a> für das Testen der maps und <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2391-nn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@??NN!!</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61163,"threadID":4156,"userID":2416,"username":"Road2Esel","subject":"","time":1486364559,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","time":1486365006,"value":1},{"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","time":1486365048,"value":1},{"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","time":1486390837,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Das war echt harte arbeit ..</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61165,"threadID":4156,"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","subject":"","time":1486365044,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2416,"username":"Road2Esel","time":1486365304,"value":1},{"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","time":1486390835,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Nr. 4 und 5 gefallen mir eigentlich. Sehen alle aber bisschen komisch aus.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61168,"threadID":4156,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1486365940,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","time":1486367551,"value":1},{"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","time":1486390833,"value":1},{"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","time":1486442227,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>TTT Maps: Wir hatten schon 1,2,3 auf dem Server. Sie haben entweder gebuggt, waren zu groß oder hatten andere Dinge weswegen wir sie aus dem Mappool entfeent haben. 4,5 könnte man mal testen</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61174,"threadID":4156,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"","time":1486375115,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","time":1486375148,"value":1},{"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","time":1486390831,"value":1},{"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","time":1486442225,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey Ibo,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>cool das du dir Maps ausgesucht hast, aber leider gefallen mir nicht alle.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Bei TTT-Maps kann ich nichts zu sagen, da ich dort ka habe wie groß oder wie klein so eine Map sein sollte. Da überlass ich die Meinung den anderen die da eher so die Spielerfahrung von der größe haben <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Kommen wir zu den Jail-Maps. An sich sind alle Maps cool, allerdings habe ich gegen 3 Maps etwas.<br>Die 1. Map ist wieder eine Electric Jailmap und wenn ich ehrlich bin finde ich schon das Dream von der Art Map genug hat. Schließlich sind die Electric Jailmaps immer auf rebellieren aus und wenn du ehrlich bist die Map sieht nur sehr minimal anders aus als die die eh schon auf dem Server sind <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Die 3. Map müsste man Ingame sehen, allerdings sieht die von den Screenshots sehr klein aus und sieht hauptsächlich nach einer Map aus wo es kaum Mapspiele gibt. Ansonsten vom Design sieht die Map nicht schlecht aus <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Und kommen wir zur letzten Map. Die 5. Map ist einfach das gleiche wie die ba_2015_minecraft und jb_minecraft_beta_v4-2 nur halt das es im Weihnachtsstyle gehalten wurde. Würde diese aber trotzdem nicht mit reinnehmen, weil es einfach nur der Style ist der anders ist.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Alle anderen Maps sehen auf den Bildern sehr gut aus und würde ich zustimmen auf den Server testen zu lassen <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Danke an dich Ibo das du dir auch diese Mühe gemacht hast.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61176,"threadID":4156,"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","subject":"","time":1486375390,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","time":1486389051,"value":1},{"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","time":1486390829,"value":1},{"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","time":1486442223,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>und und und und -----&gt; ,</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61199,"threadID":4156,"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","subject":"","time":1486390792,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","time":1486442220,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey Ibo, <br>Ich finde es cool das du dir auch ttt maps gesucht hast obwohl du nicht aktiv TTT spielst.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich werde nur die TTT maps bewerten , Ich habe mir keine map runtergeladen</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>1.ttt_moeub_alpha6</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>DIe finde ich zu Dunkel aber sonst sieht sie ganz ok aus</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>2.ttt_67thway_csgo</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Finde ich zu klein</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>3.ttt_sky_islands_csgo</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Sky islands finde ich jedenfalls cool . [Hatten wir schonmal]</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>4.ttt_bank_csgo</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Sieht  sehr interessant aus</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>5.TTT_PrincessCraft_BETA4</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wir haben genügend Minecraft maps  <span class=\"missing-media\">[thanksforit*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61200,"threadID":4156,"userID":2237,"username":"Gaara","subject":"","time":1486391186,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","time":1486391493,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1486393759,"value":1},{"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","time":1486410478,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Für TTT gibt es keine Einwände.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Aber: Von Jail Aus die Nr. 5: Wieder eine Minecraft Map???</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Sonst gute Arbeit geleistet habt ihr <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2185-ibo107/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Ibo107</a>, <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1153-schockly/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Schockly</a>, <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2391-nn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@??NN!!</a>, <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2332-exo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@exo</a>, <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2416-road2esel/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Road2Esel</a>.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61203,"threadID":4156,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1486391634,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","time":1486442215,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Gute Maps, wieder bisschen Abwechslung würde gut tuen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61206,"threadID":4156,"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","subject":"","time":1486393620,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2416,"username":"Road2Esel","time":1486444717,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><strong><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2237-sk0o/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sk0o</a>  Man könnte ja die bisherige ba_jail_minecraft mit ba_jail_xmasminecraft ersetzten um eine gewisse Abwechslung in die Maps zu bringen.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Und wie meinst du das mit : Sonst gute Arbeit geleistet habt ihr</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong></strong></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61209,"threadID":4156,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1486395732,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","time":1486398448,"value":1},{"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","time":1486410502,"value":1},{"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","time":1486447771,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich finde diese TTT Map noch schön:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=770158924\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>was haltet ihr davon?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61212,"threadID":4156,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","subject":"","time":1486397788,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","time":1486410522,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Zu den Jail Maps :</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>1. Haben wir schon<br>2. Map ist naja nicht gut<br>3. Zu klein für unsere Server Verhältnisse<br>4. Zu klein<br>5. Haben wir schon in 2003434593953 facher ausgabe außerdem ist diese Version der Minecraft Map viel zu Outdated und schlecht. Bugs sagen hallo</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":61229,"threadID":4156,"userID":2418,"username":"Neo","subject":"","time":1486428148,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":